	},
	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat020100"},
		line=787,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"I'm sitting all alone in the green room at my performance venue.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"A barely recognizable reflection stares back at me in the mirror.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"She's wearing a gorgeous costume that shimmers with every movement. Expertly applied makeup that captures the glow of the stars themselves.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"She's... ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"I'm",
{"/font"},
" not the same person I usually am.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(Life sure is a mystery sometimes...)”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Unbidden, I think back to that day.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"That day where I first set down the path of becoming a singer...",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Say, Hotori... ever wanted to become a singer?”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"Shino suddenly asks out of the blue in the middle of our lunch.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Nope.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Now, now, hear me out.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“A major company's about to ≪sponsor≫ a big event to scout new ≪idols.≫”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“The winner gets to make her ≪debut≫ from a major ≪label.≫”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Your songs'll be on every channel, and you'd get a ton of ≪sponsorship≫ deals. You could become an overnight sensation!”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"Her spiel confused me with all its Republican words, but I think she's saying there'll be a singing contest, and the winner gets to become a singer.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That has nothing to do with me.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“You don't get it. You don't get it at all...”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"She waves her finger at me with a “tsk-tsk.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“The people's hearts are wounded from the war, and the country needs a symbol of its restoration.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Empress Hisui is doing an excellent job at that.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“And two is better than one, don'tcha think?”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Come now, Hotori. Let us save the Imperial people with the power of song and dance!”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“As if a warrior would ever sing.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“You're always doing it in the shower, though.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“H-How do you know that?”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Heheheh, how indeed...”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"What a terrifying “friend” she is.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I can tell. There's a special quality to your voice, you know.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yeah... it scares people away.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Not the way you talk. The way you sing.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I've never heard a better rendition of 'My Peach Blossom\nDarling' than yours in the shower the other day.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Seriously, how do you know about that?”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hehehee...”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"I'd better check for listening devices when I get home.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“All joking aside, Hotori...”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"Shino peers into my eyes with complete seriousness.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“You need money, don't you? And more than just a little.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ugh...”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"Ever since the August Incident, the Sworn Blades' financial situation has been tight.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"Now that we've retreated underground, the ample donations we've enjoyed thus far have dried up.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"We need money for everything, whether its maintaining our facilities and equipment, gathering intelligence, or preserving the support of our members.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"Our coffers have run completely dry by now, and we're entirely reliant on personal donations from our own members to stay afloat.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We need money so badly it hurts.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“If you become a singer, you'll be popular for sure.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“No, I'll ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"make",
{"/font"},
" you popular!”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Still though... me, a singer?”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"I trip over my words just keeping up conversation with strangers. How am I ever supposed to sing in front of a crowd?",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Anything is possible with a little effort.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Plus, Soujin also said he wants to see you sing.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Come on, Soujin would never say...”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I do, though.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"Soujin suddenly appears to cut off my path of retreat.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“How much did Shino pay you?!”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's what I honestly think.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You should know better than that. We don't have time for fun and games.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This isn't a game. It's valuable work to support the Blades.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even I'm working now at the flower shop.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"All our members are doing everything they can to raise money for the Blades.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"As the acting chairman, I can't possibly just sit back and do nothing myself.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"Especially with this opportunity to make a windfall right in front of me.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I've heard you sing in class, and you're incredible.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Plus, you're more than beautiful enough to be on stage.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm... beautiful?”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're beautiful.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"I feel my cheeks flush with heat.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Having grown up surrounded only by boorish men, I have no idea how to react to an honest compliment like that.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“You could even do ≪gravure≫ without a problem.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Inou Hotori Bares Herself in Summer... The sand and the surf... A seashell bikini... 'Let's go on a summertime adventure, just the two of us☆'”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“It's perfect! Magnificent, I say!”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“In Republican, they call this feeling ≪heaven!≫”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"Shino starts panting heavily, completely forgetting about the two of us.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori, what do you say?”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“B-But... I...”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Do it for fealty.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hnn!”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"This final appeal completely does me in.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“A-Alright... just this once, okay?”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But no seashell bikinis...”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"My special training began the very next day.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"I set aside some of my time practicing bladesmanship to practice my singing and dancing instead.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Okay, one more time!”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"If I treat the dance moves like blade arts stances, it really\nisn't too difficult.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"Practice will eventually make perfect.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"And singing honestly isn't too bad either.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"It's the first time I've ever sung seriously, after all, so I have no reason to like or dislike it.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"The problem is that I have to do both at once.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Singing and dancing at the same time is a lot more tiring than I expected.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"On top of that, I have to always be mindful of my facial expressions.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"My feelings won't be able to reach the audience unless I sing with a smile on my face.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"A singer needs to convey her song with every part of her, including her body language.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"The sound of applause suddenly rings out within the dojo.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh?!”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"I turn around to find Soujin standing there.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"The shock freezes my body in place.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That was amazing.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Y-You were watching?”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"My face flushes with heat.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"I got up early to practice specifically so Soujin wouldn't see me...",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Y-You're up awfully early today!”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This is the same time as usual.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"I look at the clock and discover that it's already the usual time for our blade arts training.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"I must have been too focused on my dancing and lost track of time.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ahh, sorry. I'll wrap things up.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's fine. I'd love to see it again, if anything.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh? Wh-Why?”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't want to just watch from the side, I want a front stage view.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"My cheeks grow even hotter.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You need to get used to performing to an audience.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you wait until the big event, you'll freeze up from the nerves.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I mean... yeah, but...”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"It's still way too embarrassing.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"But if someone is gonna watch me anyway, I'd want it to be Soujin.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"Not because I wouldn't be embarrassed in front of him.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"In fact, he's the one I'd be the most embarrassed to have watching me.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"Because, well, you know....",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“O-Okay. You'd better pay close attention.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. I will.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"One day, with the qualifiers right around the corner.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ooh... I just can't do it.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"I can't help but mutter this to myself as I sit down for a short break.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"I've sung this song so many times now, but it's never come out right.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's the matter now?”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"Soujin asks as he hands me his handkerchief.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“This song I'm practicing right now is a love song.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. So it seems.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I can't help but feel like I'm just not cut out for it.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I mean, you know, I'm still a warrior after all.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Do you mean you've never fallen in love?”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“W-W-W-W-W-Well, maybe I have... maybe I haven't...”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“No, forget that! I haven't! Definitely not.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"I hurriedly make excuses for myself.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This was Shino's song choice, wasn't it? If she says you can do it, you definitely can.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Even so, it's...”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're acting so anxious. This isn't like you.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't worry. Everyone will see how beautiful you really are.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"Soujin says it like it's nothing.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“H-Hwehhh?!”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm sure your song will be able to reach them.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"Oh, he meant my singing.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your music really resonates with my heart.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't know how else to describe it.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"Soujin has never been good with words, but his clumsy praise somehow always fills me up with courage.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"It makes me want to keep trying, again and again.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"What is this tender feeling blossoming in the depths of my heart?",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"─It's almost like... the lyrics of a love song.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'll give it another shot.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin, can you keep watching me?”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course. I'll stay with you until the last minute before school starts.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"I honestly don't remember anything that happened at the qualifiers.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"My mind went completely blank long before my turn to audition came up.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"The entire time I was singing is all just one transparent blur.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"Even though I was already informed in advance, I still fainted when they actually called out my name as the winner.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"Once I made my debut, Shino's skillful promotion really did turn me into an overnight sensation.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"She really wasn't kidding when she said, “I'll make you popular!”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(Alright, gotta do my best today.)”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"I check my appearance in the mirror one last time.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"I'm a completely different person than I usually am.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"I'm wearing a long wig, a flashy costume, and a perfect face of makeup to cover up the scowling expression I'm so sick of.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"But all that is still just a superficial change in appearance.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"I can barely even keep up a proper conversation, so how in the world am I supposed to make it as a singer just by changing the way I look?",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"The truth is, I need one last ritual to be fully reborn as the singer Natsumi.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"It's a little trick Soujin taught me when we were young.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Okay!”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"Using my finger, I write the word “fealty” on my palm.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"And then─",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“For fealty, for fealty, for fealty, for fealty...”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“For fealty! For fealty! For fealty! For fealty!”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Haaaah!”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"I squeeze my eyes shut and swallow the writing on my palm.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"The “fealty” slides down my throat and enters my stomach.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"In my mind, I imagine it getting broken down within me and spreading out to every last corner of my body.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"There. I'm now entirely at one with my fealty.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Fealty complete!”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"I'm not scared, I'm not scared, I'm not scared!",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"I finally open my eyes once again.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"The famous singer at top of the world, Natsumi, stares back at me.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"I am no longer the Inou Hotori who hears nothing but\n“You're scary!” or “Are you angry at me?” or “I'm sorry...” or “This is all the lunch money I have!”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Natsumi"},
			{
"“Morning, everyone! Iiiit's Natsumi!”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Natsumi"},
			{
"“I'm gonna sing my heart out for you today, so keep listening to the very end, you hear?♪”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"Basking in the spotlight, I sing my song with all my heart.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"─To reach far and wide across the whole Empire.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"─To heal some of the pain left by the war on the Imperial people.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"─And to maybe, just maybe, convey even the slightest bit of my feelings to Soujin.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"The venue surges and bursts forth with excitement.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"The audience erupts in applause.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Thank you for your support, everyone!”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"I put on my best smile in response to all the cheers.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"Ah, everyone looks so happy.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"I must have done a good job, right?",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"The concert is an overwhelming success.",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"In fact, the audience is so fired up that they call for an encore.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"After I finish my second number, I scan the venue once again.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"Men and women of every age are standing shoulder to shoulder.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"And every last one of them is cheering on Natsumi from the bottom of their hearts.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"All I can do is sincerely thank them for their support once again.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(Thank you all for supporting the likes of me.)”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(Right now, the most I can do is sing for you as Natsumi...)”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(But someday, I'll reclaim the Empire with my own two hands.)”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"Smiling and waving all the while, I begin heading backstage, but...",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"I spot a familiar face in the audience.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"What is Maki doing here?",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"I've forbidden the members of the Sworn Blades from coming to my concerts.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"It's important to downplay the connection between Natsumi and the Sworn Blades as much as possible.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"...I'm not mistaken, it really is him.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"Still looking in his direction, I begin stepping down from the stage.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"In a lapse of concentration, I trip over my own feet.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"The audience lets out a collective gasp.",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Nnh!”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"I'd allowed myself to get distracted for just a moment.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			{
"I barely manage to catch myself before I fall.",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Don't worry! I'm A-okay!”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			{
"At my flustered smile and wave, the venue breathes out a huge collective sigh of relief.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
